	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:03,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3740
			},
			"text": "事业投资 对吧 很多东西是可以靠战略解决的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:04,140",
				"to": "00:00:10,340"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 4140,
				"to": 10340
			},
			"text": "但是对我们年线来说 婚姻和家庭好像没有那么容易"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,740",
				"to": "00:00:14,340"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10740,
				"to": 14340
			},
			"text": "那您现在是如何看婚姻和家庭这个事情的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,100",
				"to": "00:00:17,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15100,
				"to": 17920
			},
			"text": "其实这个东西啊 实话是说 我也在摸索"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,200",
				"to": "00:00:24,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19200,
				"to": 24060
			},
			"text": "如果我不是自己在摸索 我也有固定答案 我也不会 对吧 前面"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,820",
				"to": "00:00:27,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24820,
				"to": 27400
			},
			"text": "上个月有这个风波 对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:27,660",
				"to": "00:00:32,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 27660,
				"to": 32660
			},
			"text": "这个记者也采访我 我也很实话是说 我很多东西我都不知道是对是错"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:33,160",
				"to": "00:00:36,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 33160,
				"to": 36360
			},
			"text": "所以这个为什么我叫Klaus 对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:36,860",
				"to": "00:00:40,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 36860,
				"to": 40560
			},
			"text": "就是我还问Klaus 对 怎么处理"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:40,560",
				"to": "00:00:42,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 40560,
				"to": 42560
			},
			"text": "我自己都不知道 而且这个"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:43,360",
				"to": "00:00:47,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 43360,
				"to": 47360
			},
			"text": "我其实那个文章很多人看了之后第一反应说"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:47,360",
				"to": "00:00:53,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 47360,
				"to": 53460
			},
			"text": "孙晨又是要撑热度 撑热度 孙晨就疯狂想撑热度"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,460",
				"to": "00:00:57,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53460,
				"to": 57320
			},
			"text": "因为这个其实也都是一些胡扯的理论"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:57,320",
				"to": "00:00:59,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 57320,
				"to": 59040
			},
			"text": "但是很多人就相信了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:59,040",
				"to": "00:01:01,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 59040,
				"to": 61140
			},
			"text": "我不知道有人为什么就这个相信"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:01,140",
				"to": "00:01:05,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 61140,
				"to": 65080
			},
			"text": "说随着那个币就是靠随着这个热度上的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:05,080",
				"to": "00:01:07,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 65080,
				"to": 67040
			},
			"text": "随着那个币没有任何用"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:07,040",
				"to": "00:01:10,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 67040,
				"to": 70200
			},
			"text": "就是靠多少人知道他这个币就过来嘛"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:10,200",
				"to": "00:01:12,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 70200,
				"to": 72040
			},
			"text": "你这首先就胡扯"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:12,040",
				"to": "00:01:14,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 72040,
				"to": 74600
			},
			"text": "这个第一个我没知道谁知道我这个"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:14,600",
				"to": "00:01:16,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 74600,
				"to": 76540
			},
			"text": "我就按着他的头会买我币吗"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:16,540",
				"to": "00:01:19,340"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 76540,
				"to": 79340
			},
			"text": "没有嘛我没有做过任何这样的事"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,340",
				"to": "00:01:21,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79340,
				"to": 81900
			},
			"text": "我 我想法呢"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:21,900",
				"to": "00:01:26,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 81900,
				"to": 86500
			},
			"text": "这个文章包包飞特这个都是我人生探索路径下"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:26,500",
				"to": "00:01:29,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 86500,
				"to": 89380
			},
			"text": "我真的不明白"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,380",
				"to": "00:01:34,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89380,
				"to": 94580
			},
			"text": "我表达引起社会共鸣之后的一个节目"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:34,580",
				"to": "00:01:39,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 94580,
				"to": 99540
			},
			"text": "对感情 对婚姻以及对当下的这个契约"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:39,540",
				"to": "00:01:42,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 99540,
				"to": 102380
			},
			"text": "确实是一种混顿和看不懂的状态"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:42,380",
				"to": "00:01:43,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 102380,
				"to": 103900
			},
			"text": "对 确实看不懂"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:43,900",
				"to": "00:01:47,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 103900,
				"to": 107820
			},
			"text": "我要看懂我也不会发出这个世纪之问了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:47,820",
				"to": "00:01:54,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 107820,
				"to": 114160
			},
			"text": "比如說大家有一個 當然現在後來晚上大家各自有各自的答案"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:54,160",
				"to": "00:02:02,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 114160,
				"to": 122060
			},
			"text": "就是一個世紀之外 你就說 我那個五千萬如果給了他還會不會走"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:02,060",
				"to": "00:02:03,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 122060,
				"to": 123740
			},
			"text": "我覺得會"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:03,740",
				"to": "00:02:10,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 123740,
				"to": 130040
			},
			"text": "對 你講得非常對 現在答案因為後來晚上太多這個博主討論這個問題"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:10,040",
				"to": "00:02:14,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 130040,
				"to": 134720
			},
			"text": "我覺得正確答案是會 而且有的博主已經推倒出來了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:14,720",
				"to": "00:02:16,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 134720,
				"to": 136920
			},
			"text": "這個五個億也走"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:16,920",
				"to": "00:02:18,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 136920,
				"to": 138120
			},
			"text": "五十億也走"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:18,120",
				"to": "00:02:19,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 138120,
				"to": 139520
			},
			"text": "五八個億也走"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:19,520",
				"to": "00:02:20,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 139520,
				"to": 140320
			},
			"text": "對"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:20,320",
				"to": "00:02:21,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 140320,
				"to": 141320
			},
			"text": "啊 我同意"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:21,320",
				"to": "00:02:23,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 141320,
				"to": 143320
			},
			"text": "啊 甚至有的博主已經發明出來了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:23,320",
				"to": "00:02:25,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 143320,
				"to": 145520
			},
			"text": "說這個巴菲特來接盤什麼時候走"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:25,520",
				"to": "00:02:27,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 145520,
				"to": 147120
			},
			"text": "對吧 能堅持多少天"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:27,120",
				"to": "00:02:28,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 147120,
				"to": 148520
			},
			"text": "它有個算數那時候"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:28,520",
				"to": "00:02:30,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 148520,
				"to": 150520
			},
			"text": "所以只能堅持200多天"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:30,520",
				"to": "00:02:32,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 150520,
				"to": 152520
			},
			"text": "我巴菲特能堅持300天"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:32,520",
				"to": "00:02:34,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 152520,
				"to": 154320
			},
			"text": "一路挖這個堅持400天"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:34,320",
				"to": "00:02:36,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 154320,
				"to": 156720
			},
			"text": "這麼美聯主堅持600多天"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:39,520",
				"to": "00:02:40,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 159520,
				"to": 160720
			},
			"text": "這條理論很有意思"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:40,720",
				"to": "00:02:42,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 160720,
				"to": 162120
			},
			"text": "但是這一個就是"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:42,120",
				"to": "00:02:43,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 162120,
				"to": 163720
			},
			"text": "我覺得就是"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:43,720",
				"to": "00:02:48,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 163720,
				"to": 168100
			},
			"text": "這個東西,當然我現在不完全懂啊,否則今天我們就會講這個話題了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:48,100",
				"to": "00:02:58,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 168100,
				"to": 178060
			},
			"text": "就是這個其實也很核心的一個理論,我們不一定領悟,但是我覺得就是也是,我可以講出一些"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:58,060",
				"to": "00:03:02,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 178060,
				"to": 182060
			},
			"text": "首先一滴感情的事根據多少錢,沒關係"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:02,060",
				"to": "00:03:11,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 182060,
				"to": 191920
			},
			"text": "對,真是個老人,就是說你不要試圖在感情中,尤其這種愛情中"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:11,920",
				"to": "00:03:14,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 191920,
				"to": 194220
			},
			"text": "試圖用金錢的這個問題"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:14,220",
				"to": "00:03:15,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 194220,
				"to": 195240
			},
			"text": "沒有用"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:15,240",
				"to": "00:03:19,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 195240,
				"to": 199100
			},
			"text": "其實也是個認知剛才我們講這個認知"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:19,100",
				"to": "00:03:20,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 199100,
				"to": 200620
			},
			"text": "這個理論"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:20,620",
				"to": "00:03:23,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 200620,
				"to": 203940
			},
			"text": "金錢其實他就是這個講的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:23,940",
				"to": "00:03:25,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 203940,
				"to": 205480
			},
			"text": "他可能也是一個放大氣"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:25,480",
				"to": "00:03:30,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 205480,
				"to": 210100
			},
			"text": "他愛和不愛他有個前面有個本質性的一個輸入輸出"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:30,100",
				"to": "00:03:33,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 210100,
				"to": 213180
			},
			"text": "你後面的金錢他這個放大氣愛可能更愛"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:33,180",
				"to": "00:03:34,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 213180,
				"to": 214300
			},
			"text": "不愛就不愛"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:34,300",
				"to": "00:03:37,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 214300,
				"to": 217780
			},
			"text": "但是你說你能不能說我前面把這個結果撤離改了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:37,780",
				"to": "00:03:39,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 217780,
				"to": 219320
			},
			"text": "可能改不了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:39,320",
				"to": "00:03:43,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 219320,
				"to": 223000
			},
			"text": "這是第一個 我覺得一個想法"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:43,000",
				"to": "00:03:47,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 223000,
				"to": 227080
			},
			"text": "就是他感情熱東西他可能跟錢確實關係不大"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:47,080",
				"to": "00:03:50,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 227080,
				"to": 230200
			},
			"text": "對 感情跟錢關係不大"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:50,200",
				"to": "00:03:53,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 230200,
				"to": 233100
			},
			"text": "第二個就是說 怎麼說他感情熱東西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:53,100",
				"to": "00:03:56,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 233100,
				"to": 236620
			},
			"text": "我覺得特別 特別主觀的一個東西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:56,620",
				"to": "00:04:00,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 236620,
				"to": 240200
			},
			"text": "所以這個就是更讓你看不清"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:00,200",
				"to": "00:04:04,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 240200,
				"to": 244800
			},
			"text": "就比如說很多我們經常講的 看完笑講"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:04,800",
				"to": "00:04:09,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 244800,
				"to": 249640
			},
			"text": "说 经常那个情感大师自己给原分析的时候 头头是倒的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:09,640",
				"to": "00:04:12,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 249640,
				"to": 252200
			},
			"text": "对 当局者是非常"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:12,200",
				"to": "00:04:16,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 252200,
				"to": 256520
			},
			"text": "他的视角是受限 他不是在一个更客观的角度去看的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:16,520",
				"to": "00:04:19,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 256520,
				"to": 259200
			},
			"text": "对 情感大师给别人分析 头头是倒的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:19,200",
				"to": "00:04:22,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 259200,
				"to": 262760
			},
			"text": "然后 情感大师自己呢 最后进入那个感情中呢"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:24,760",
				"to": "00:04:29,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 264760,
				"to": 269640
			},
			"text": "情感大师自己都被搞的就是 这种五迷三道的对吧 言"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:30,640",
				"to": "00:04:34,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 270640,
				"to": 274600
			},
			"text": "也出来 完全有可能 因为他这个感情这个东西非常主观"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:34,800",
				"to": "00:04:41,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 274800,
				"to": 281400
			},
			"text": "這個所以這就為什麼我們中國有鼓話說是清官難斷家務是嘛"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:41,400",
				"to": "00:04:47,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 281400,
				"to": 287060
			},
			"text": "你再聰明的人再聰明的官你去斷邊的家務是你很難斷"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:47,060",
				"to": "00:04:49,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 287060,
				"to": 289240
			},
			"text": "因為家務是很主觀"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:49,240",
				"to": "00:04:53,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 289240,
				"to": 293720
			},
			"text": "但是主觀不意味著沒有規律"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:53,720",
				"to": "00:04:57,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 293720,
				"to": 297420
			},
			"text": "這個規律還是要學習還是要摸索"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:57,420",
				"to": "00:04:59,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 297420,
				"to": 299800
			},
			"text": "雖然我現在也沒完全想通"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:59,800",
				"to": "00:05:02,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 299800,
				"to": 302800
			},
			"text": "實話是說因為我自己我也不能說裝不懂裝懂"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:02,800",
				"to": "00:05:04,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 302800,
				"to": 304080
			},
			"text": "因為我沒結過婚"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:04,340",
				"to": "00:05:07,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 304340,
				"to": 307140
			},
			"text": "我在這個婚姻邊緣摸鎖了一下"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:07,140",
				"to": "00:05:08,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 307140,
				"to": 308180
			},
			"text": "但我沒結過婚"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:08,440",
				"to": "00:05:10,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 308440,
				"to": 310220
			},
			"text": "我也沒有成立家庭"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:10,480",
				"to": "00:05:12,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 310480,
				"to": 312020
			},
			"text": "我現在還沒小孩呢"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:12,020",
				"to": "00:05:12,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 312020,
				"to": 312780
			},
			"text": "所以我也不敢"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:13,040",
				"to": "00:05:14,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 313040,
				"to": 314060
			},
			"text": "冒男去說"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:14,060",
				"to": "00:05:16,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 314060,
				"to": 316380
			},
			"text": "因為我這肯定沒有有婚姻有家庭的人懂"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:16,380",
				"to": "00:05:17,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 316380,
				"to": 317660
			},
			"text": "因為他沒人家更懂"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:18,420",
				"to": "00:05:18,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 318420,
				"to": 318920
			},
			"text": "就是"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:19,440",
				"to": "00:05:21,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 319440,
				"to": 321240
			},
			"text": "但是我自己"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:21,500",
				"to": "00:05:22,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 321500,
				"to": 322520
			},
			"text": "也得摸鎖"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:22,760",
				"to": "00:05:25,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 322760,
				"to": 325580
			},
			"text": "這為什麼我後來給胡錫進回的那個信裡面"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:25,580",
				"to": "00:05:26,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 325580,
				"to": 326360
			},
			"text": "我就很擔層"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:26,360",
				"to": "00:05:27,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 326360,
				"to": 327640
			},
			"text": "我沒有給他是"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:28,140",
				"to": "00:05:28,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 328140,
				"to": 328920
			},
			"text": "去掩蓋"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:29,420",
				"to": "00:05:30,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 329420,
				"to": 330960
			},
			"text": "我就說我這個東西不懂"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:30,960",
				"to": "00:05:32,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 330960,
				"to": 332500
			},
			"text": "但是我這個不懂"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:32,800",
				"to": "00:05:34,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 332800,
				"to": 334600
			},
			"text": "不是我一个人的问题"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:34,600",
				"to": "00:05:35,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 334600,
				"to": 335600
			},
			"text": "这个时代都不是"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:35,600",
				"to": "00:05:37,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 335600,
				"to": 337920
			},
			"text": "这个是中国两个亿人"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:37,920",
				"to": "00:05:38,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 337920,
				"to": 338940
			},
			"text": "都这个问题"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:38,940",
				"to": "00:05:40,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 338940,
				"to": 340740
			},
			"text": "因为这两个亿没结婚啊"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:40,740",
				"to": "00:05:42,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 340740,
				"to": 342540
			},
			"text": "我觉得甚至是全球的问题"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:42,540",
				"to": "00:05:44,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 342540,
				"to": 344060
			},
			"text": "我认为是全球的问题"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:44,060",
				"to": "00:05:45,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 344060,
				"to": 345860
			},
			"text": "美国其他国家也认为"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:45,860",
				"to": "00:05:47,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 345860,
				"to": 347400
			},
			"text": "韩国日本都是一样的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:47,400",
				"to": "00:05:48,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 347400,
				"to": 348920
			},
			"text": "都是有这个关系"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:49,700",
				"to": "00:05:50,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 349700,
				"to": 350460
			},
			"text": "对都这个问题"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:50,460",
				"to": "00:05:51,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 350460,
				"to": 351740
			},
			"text": "你说太对了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:51,740",
				"to": "00:05:52,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 351740,
				"to": 352760
			},
			"text": "对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:52,760",
				"to": "00:05:54,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 352760,
				"to": 354300
			},
			"text": "是个全球性的问题"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:54,300",
				"to": "00:05:55,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 354300,
				"to": 355320
			},
			"text": "对"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:55,320",
				"to": "00:05:57,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 355320,
				"to": 357620
			},
			"text": "当然我个人呢也是在摸索"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:57,620",
				"to": "00:05:59,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 357620,
				"to": 359420
			},
			"text": "我个人也是在摸索"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:59,420",
				"to": "00:06:02,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 359420,
				"to": 362500
			},
			"text": "其实我感觉我仿佛在这个规律中"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:02,500",
				"to": "00:06:04,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 362500,
				"to": 364500
			},
			"text": "最终我感觉我有一套理论和答案"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:04,500",
				"to": "00:06:07,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 364500,
				"to": 367500
			},
			"text": "包括我要做那些视频黄毛思维"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:07,500",
				"to": "00:06:08,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 367500,
				"to": 368500
			},
			"text": "这个"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:08,500",
				"to": "00:06:10,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 368500,
				"to": 370500
			},
			"text": "什么感兴趣的话我们可以私下"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:10,500",
				"to": "00:06:13,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 370500,
				"to": 373500
			},
			"text": "给你离离它背后的逻辑和规矩"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:13,500",
				"to": "00:06:14,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 373500,
				"to": 374500
			},
			"text": "对"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:14,500",
				"to": "00:06:15,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 374500,
				"to": 375500
			},
			"text": "好"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:15,500",
				"to": "00:06:16,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 375500,
				"to": 376500
			},
			"text": "好"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:16,500",
				"to": "00:06:18,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 376500,
				"to": 378500
			},
			"text": "你可以把那些视频讲发给我"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:18,500",
				"to": "00:06:19,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 378500,
				"to": 379500
			},
			"text": "我现在都能读一下"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:19,500",
				"to": "00:06:21,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 379500,
				"to": 381500
			},
			"text": "你可以看一下看有没有道理"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:21,500",
				"to": "00:06:23,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 381500,
				"to": 383500
			},
			"text": "你觉得有道理在继续探讨"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:23,500",
				"to": "00:06:24,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 383500,
				"to": 384500
			},
			"text": "对"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:25,500",
				"to": "00:06:27,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 385500,
				"to": 387500
			},
			"text": "但这个我觉得也是"
